# Umoria Japanese (ja) message catalog
#
# This is the Japanese translation catalog for the umoria-jp localization
# fork. Covers UI messages, monster/item/race/class names, class rank
# titles, and unidentified-item flavor words. See docs/TRANSLATING.md
# for the catalog format and the i18n mechanism this file is loaded by.
#
# Format: a small subset of the gettext .po format (msgid/msgstr pairs,
# multi-line string concatenation, and \\ \" \n \t escapes). Untranslated
# entries (empty msgstr, or simply absent) fall back to the English msgid.
#
# Hengband attribution: a portion of the monster/item/class-rank-title
# vocabulary below was originally adapted from Hengband
# (https://hengband.github.io/), a separate, unrelated project
# distributed under a non-commercial-only license that is not
# GPL-compatible. Each borrowed entry was individually reviewed for
# creative content: entries that are plain dictionary-level translations
# or pure katakana phonetic transliterations (i.e. not creative/original
# expression, and so not considered Hengband's copyrightable work) were
# kept and are credited to Hengband here as a courtesy; entries that
# involved a creative or interpretive translation choice were replaced
# with original wording not derived from Hengband. See README.md's
# "Japanese translation data and Hengband attribution" section for more.

