# Phase 7 (scope extension): store haggle speech (data_store_owners.cpp speech_* arrays)
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "商談成立！"

msgid "Accepted!"
msgstr "受け入れよう！"

msgid "Fine."
msgstr "いいだろう。"

msgid "Agreed!"
msgstr "合意だ！"

msgid "Ok."
msgstr "了解。"

msgid "Taken!"
msgstr "手を打とう！"

msgid "You drive a hard bargain, but taken."
msgstr "手強い交渉だが、受けよう。"

msgid "You'll force me bankrupt, but it's a deal."
msgstr "破産させる気か、だが取引成立だ。"

msgid "Sigh.  I'll take it."
msgstr "はぁ…、いいだろう。"

msgid "My poor sick children may starve, but done!"
msgstr "病気の子供たちが飢えてしまうが、商談成立だ！"

msgid "Finally!  I accept."
msgstr "ようやくか！受け入れよう。"

msgid "Robbed again."
msgstr "また身ぐるみ剥がされたな。"

msgid "A pleasure to do business with you!"
msgstr "あなたと取引できて光栄だ！"

msgid "My spouse will skin me, but accepted."
msgstr "女房に叱られそうだが、受け入れよう。"

msgid "%A2 is my final offer; take it or leave it."
msgstr "%A2が最終提示額だ。買うか買わないか決めろ。"

msgid "I'll give you no more than %A2."
msgstr "%A2以上はまけられん。"

msgid "My patience grows thin.  %A2 is final."
msgstr "我慢の限界だ。%A2で決まりだ。"

msgid "%A1 for such a fine item?  HA!  No less than %A2."
msgstr "こんな逸品が%A1だと？ハッ！%A2は下げられん。"

msgid "%A1 is an insult!  Try %A2 gold pieces."
msgstr "%A1とは侮辱だ！%A2ゴールドでどうだ。"

msgid "%A1?!?  You would rob my poor starving children?"
msgstr "%A1だと？！飢えた我が子から奪う気か？"

msgid "Why, I'll take no less than %A2 gold pieces."
msgstr "いいや、%A2ゴールド以上でなければ渡せん。"

msgid "Ha!  No less than %A2 gold pieces."
msgstr "ハッ！%A2ゴールド以上だ。"

msgid "Thou knave!  No less than %A2 gold pieces."
msgstr "この悪党め！%A2ゴールド以上だ。"

msgid "%A1 is far too little, how about %A2?"
msgstr "%A1では安すぎる、%A2はどうだ？"

msgid "I paid more than %A1 for it myself, try %A2."
msgstr "仕入れで%A1以上払ったんだ、%A2にしてくれ。"

msgid "%A1?  Are you mad?!?  How about %A2 gold pieces?"
msgstr "%A1だと？正気か？！%A2ゴールドはどうだ？"

msgid "As scrap this would bring %A1.  Try %A2 in gold."
msgstr "くず鉄にしても%A1にはなる。%A2ゴールドでどうだ。"

msgid "May the fleas of 1000 Orcs molest you.  I want %A2."
msgstr "千匹のオークのノミにたかられるがいい。%A2欲しいんだ。"

msgid "My mother you can get for %A1, this costs %A2."
msgstr "わしの母親なら%A1で譲るが、これは%A2だ。"

msgid "May your chickens grow lips.  I want %A2 in gold!"
msgstr "お前の鶏に唇が生えるがいい。%A2ゴールド欲しいんだ！"

msgid "Sell this for such a pittance?  Give me %A2 gold."
msgstr "こんな端金で売れというのか？%A2ゴールドよこせ。"

msgid "May the Balrog find you tasty!  %A2 gold pieces?"
msgstr "バルログにでも食われるがいい！%A2ゴールドでどうだ？"

msgid "Your mother was a Troll!  %A2 or I'll tell."
msgstr "お前の母親はトロルだったな！%A2でなきゃバラすぞ。"

msgid "I'll pay no more than %A1; take it or leave it."
msgstr "%A1以上は払えん。売るか売らないか決めろ。"

msgid "You'll get no more than %A1 from me."
msgstr "わしからは%A1以上は引き出せんぞ。"

msgid "%A1 and that's final."
msgstr "%A1、これで最後だ。"

msgid "%A2 for that piece of junk?  No more than %A1."
msgstr "そのガラクタに%A2？%A1が精一杯だ。"

msgid "For %A2 I could own ten of those.  Try %A1."
msgstr "%A2あればそれが十個買える。%A1にしてくれ。"

msgid "%A2?  NEVER!  %A1 is more like it."
msgstr "%A2だと？とんでもない！%A1が妥当だろう。"

msgid "Let's be reasonable. How about %A1 gold pieces?"
msgstr "妥当な線でいこう。%A1ゴールドでどうだ？"

msgid "%A1 gold for that junk, no more."
msgstr "そのガラクタには%A1ゴールドが限度だ。"

msgid "%A1 gold pieces and be thankful for it!"
msgstr "%A1ゴールドで、それでも感謝しろ！"

msgid "%A1 gold pieces and not a copper more."
msgstr "%A1ゴールド、それ以上は一文も出さん。"

msgid "%A2 gold?  HA!  %A1 is more like it."
msgstr "%A2ゴールドだと？ハッ！%A1が妥当だ。"

msgid "Try about %A1 gold."
msgstr "%A1ゴールドあたりでどうだ。"

msgid "I wouldn't pay %A2 for your children, try %A1."
msgstr "お前の子供にすら%A2は払わんぞ、%A1にしろ。"

msgid "*CHOKE* For that!?  Let's say %A1."
msgstr "*ゲホッ* それにか！？%A1としよう。"

msgid "How about %A1?"
msgstr "%A1でどうだ？"

msgid "That looks war surplus!  Say %A1 gold."
msgstr "戦争の余り物のようだな！%A1ゴールドと言っておこう。"

msgid "I'll buy it as scrap for %A1."
msgstr "くず鉄として%A1で買い取ろう。"

msgid "%A2 is too much, let us say %A1 gold."
msgstr "%A2は高すぎる、%A1ゴールドにしておこう。"

msgid "ENOUGH!  You have abused me once too often!"
msgstr "もう十分だ！何度も無礼を働きおって！"

msgid "THAT DOES IT!  You shall waste my time no more!"
msgstr "もう我慢ならん！これ以上時間を無駄にさせん！"

msgid "This is getting nowhere.  I'm going home!"
msgstr "らちが明かん。もう帰らせてもらう！"

msgid "BAH!  No more shall you insult me!"
msgstr "フン！もう侮辱はさせんぞ！"

msgid "Begone!  I have had enough abuse for one day."
msgstr "去れ！今日はもう十分な無礼を受けた。"

msgid "Out of my place!"
msgstr "わしの店から出ていけ！"

msgid "out... Out... OUT!!!"
msgstr "出て…出ていけ…出ていけ！！！"

msgid "Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "また明日来い。"

msgid "Leave my place.  Begone!"
msgstr "わしの店から失せろ。去れ！"

msgid "Come back when thou art richer."
msgstr "もっと金を持ってから出直せ。"

msgid "You will have to do better than that!"
msgstr "もっといい条件を出してもらわないとな！"

msgid "That's an insult!"
msgstr "それは侮辱だ！"

msgid "Do you wish to do business or not?"
msgstr "取引する気があるのか、ないのか？"

msgid "Hah!  Try again."
msgstr "ハッ！もう一度言ってみろ。"

msgid "Ridiculous!"
msgstr "ばかばかしい！"

msgid "You've got to be kidding!"
msgstr "冗談だろう！"

msgid "You'd better be kidding!"
msgstr "冗談であってほしいものだな！"

msgid "You try my patience."
msgstr "わしの我慢を試す気か。"

msgid "I don't hear you."
msgstr "聞こえんな。"

msgid "Hmmm, nice weather we're having."
msgstr "うーむ、今日はいい天気だな。"

msgid "I must have heard you wrong."
msgstr "聞き間違えたに違いない。"

msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "今何と言った？"

msgid "I'm sorry, say that again."
msgstr "すまんが、もう一度言ってくれ。"

msgid "What did you say?"
msgstr "何と言ったんだ？"

msgid "Sorry, what was that again?"
msgstr "すまん、もう一度何だって？"


